<title>UK: SBC sets warrants on Imperial Tobacco Group.</title>
<headline>SBC sets warrants on Imperial Tobacco Group.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corporation has issued one million American-style call warrants, on Imperial Tobacco Group plc, lead manager SBC Warburg said.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    4.00 STG		  ISSUE PRICE  0.475 STG</p>
<p> PREMIUM	   20.3 PCT (BREAK EVEN)GEARING	7.8 X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	29.MAY.98		 PAYDATE	09.DEC.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   LONDON		    MIN EXER LOT 1000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  3.72 STG</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
